      <!-- reason for adventuring -->
      <string id="CCR_Reason_travel"              text="to discover the world" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_travel"         text="The temptation of travel was to much for you, as you always dreamt of seeing the world." />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_revenge"             text="to take revenge" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_revenge"        text="After being wronged, you felt the need for revenge. With that goal in mind, you wandered throughout Calradia to get reparations" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_forced_out"          text="after being forced out" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_forced_out"     text="After one last disagreement with you, your parents forced you out. With nowhere to go, adventuring was all you could do" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_money"               text="in search of money" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_money"          text="You always wanted to make riches, and it was obvious for you that staying at home would never allow you do it." />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_power"               text="to become one of the powerful" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_power"          text="Seeing how those in power had many advantages, you joined on an adventure to join them, or even replace them." />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_history"             text="to mark history" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_history"        text="With all the wars in Calradia, there are many way one could carve {?PLAYER.GENDER}her{?}his{\?} name in history." />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_loss"                text="after the loss of a loved one" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_loss"           text="After losing some close to you, you left to see if you could fill that hole" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_crafting"            text="to practice your trade" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_crafting"       text="Your craftmanship has been an important part of your life, but your skill wasn't enough. You thus decided to embark on a journey to improve at it." />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_helping"             text="to help those in need" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_helping"        text="Having been taught in medicine, you decide to set out and help those in need, as with the wars many have suffered." />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_prove_worth"         text="to prove your fighting skills" />
      <string id="CCR_Reason_desc_prove_worth"    text="Attaching much importance to your fighting skill, you figured there was no better place than calradia to prove your might." />
  
      <!-- starting age -->
      <string id="CCR_Age_16_desc"                text="Some might say you are too young, but your eagerness more than makes up for your lack of experience." />
